    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Vintage Botanical Jewelry Box | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover a decorative ceramic jewelry box by Tila Home, selected by KASODI for its botanical pattern, bird and butterfly details and antique-inspired gold accents."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/new-finds">New Finds</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Vintage Botanical Jewelry Box</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/new-finds/vintage-botanical-jewelry-box.png"
            alt="Vintage botanical ceramic jewelry box styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            NEW FINDS · DECORATIVE OBJECTS
          </p>

          <h1>
            Vintage Botanical<br />
            Jewelry Box
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Tila Home
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A decorative ceramic box with the character of a vintage collected
            object. Its soft turquoise surface is illustrated with delicate
            branches, birds, flowers and butterflies, while antique-gold edging,
            sculptural feet and an ornate lid handle give the piece a richer,
            jewellery-box feel.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Ceramic</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Size</span>
              <strong>16.5 × 13 × 14.5 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Turquoise · Antique gold</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Style</span>
              <strong>Vintage inspired</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Pattern</span>
              <strong>Botanical · Birds · Butterflies</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Ideal for</span>
              <strong>Jewelry · Keepsakes · Shelf styling</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://temu.to/k/e7312gffekn"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            We like pieces that are useful without looking purely practical,
            and this little ceramic box does exactly that. The botanical
            illustration, birds and butterflies give it the feeling of a
            decorative vintage find rather than ordinary storage.
          </p>

          <p>
            The turquoise and aged-gold palette makes it particularly easy to
            use as a small accent among warm wood, old books, ceramics or a
            collection of objects. At approximately 16.5 × 13 cm, it has enough
            presence to be noticed on a dressing table, console or shelf while
            remaining compact enough for jewelry and small keepsakes.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>A decorative place for little treasures</h2>

        <p>
          Dust gently with a soft, dry cloth. Avoid abrasive cleaners and
          prolonged moisture, especially around the painted decoration and
          antique-effect gold details. Lift the lid carefully by the decorative
          handle and place the box on a stable surface.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Warm Wood</h3>
            <p>
              Place it on walnut, oak or another warm wooden surface to bring
              out the antique-gold detailing.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Vintage Mirrors</h3>
            <p>
              An aged brass or carved wooden mirror gives the box the feeling
              of a collected dressing-table piece.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Soft Florals</h3>
            <p>
              Cream flowers and leafy branches soften the turquoise tones and
              echo the botanical decoration.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>NEW FINDS</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/new-finds/vintage-butterfly-photo-frame"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/vintage-butterfly-photo-frame.png"
                alt="Vintage Butterfly Photo Frame"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>DECORATIVE OBJECTS</span>
              <h3>Vintage Butterfly Photo Frame</h3>
              <p>LEYI DECOR</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>
          </a>


          <a
            href="/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates.png"
                alt="Blue Floral Dessert Plates"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>TABLEWARE</span>
              <h3>Blue Floral Dessert Plates</h3>
              <p>fanquare</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>
          </a>


          <a
            href="/kasodi-edit/botanical-vintage-pitcher"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-floral-ceramic-pitcher.png"
                alt="Botanical Vintage Pitcher"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>HOME DECOR</span>
              <h3>Botanical Vintage Pitcher</h3>
              <p>Ethereal Eves</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>
          </a>


        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          TILA HOME · VINTAGE DETAILS
        </p>

        <h2>
          A decorative place<br />
          for little treasures.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://temu.to/k/e7312gffekn"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>